ayer</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\nA Sweaty Cyclops: Hum Humm! Welcume lil' <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>soul orb</b><br/>\nA Sweaty Cyclops: Uh. Me can make some nasty lil' bolt from soul orbs. Lil' one want to trade all?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nA Sweaty Cyclops: Cling clang!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Sweaty Cyclops Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<div class=\"tw-item-obtained\"><div class=\"tw-bp-head\">Obtained</div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot\"><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-link\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Infernal%20Bolt\"> </a></div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-count\">3</div><div class=\"tw-bp-slot-img\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Infernal_Bolt_6b7307.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></div>\n<p>In case you don't have enough capacity for the bolts, Big Ben will reply with:\n</p>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nA Sweaty Cyclops: No can do. Make some room in your inventory first.<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">The Sweaty Cyclops Quest</strong></span>\nNote, that as a smith by trade, he's not great at math and won't subtract the weight of soul orbs first.\nThis means, if you want to make the bolts in batches of 1000 soul orbs, you have to start with 2900 oz of free capacity, not 3000*0.9=2700 oz.\nAlternatively, to simplify calculations, just assume each bolt weigths exactly 1 oz.\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["barbarian-outfits-quest","knight-outfits-quest","obsidian-knife-quest","the-hidden-city-of-beregar-quest","warrior-outfits-quest"]}